ak"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とゆことで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正解でございますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/10/19/9442517/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バカリボン3人組。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーんも計画してないのに\nみーんなバカリボンだったんだよね笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっすが中3組。(現高2組。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今回は！！\n自ら載せて欲しいってゆってくれた♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/10/19/9442517/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなわかんない自信あると申しておりましたで〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/10/19/9442517/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わっかるかなー？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(●´-` ●)(●´-` ●)(●´-` ●)(●´-` ●)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂って、ここ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アップされました(｢･ω･)｢"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとさいとうコンビで司会もやらせていただきまして(｢･ω･)｢\nありがたしっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやはりラジオもこなすゆったんのトーク力には脱帽......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと頑張って勉強しなきゃ！！！\nと思った1日でした(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2013/10/19/9442517/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"brea